text:
Haiku:

    A rainy day, 

        a cold November night;
            I am so alone.


Free verse:

   The rain is falling outside my window;
      it's cold and wet and I don't know why it's raining today.
         My room isn't warm or cozy enough to keep me from being sad.



Lyric Poem:

Rain drops on my face like a curtain of tears;
the wind howls at night as it screams my name;
no one ever seems to care about this misery that I feel

Yet he did not leave me utterly ;
 He hath left me now and then to love him,
 To see his name engraven upon my heart:
